            "text": "<p>Vacuums wet and dry debris. The washable pre-filter coupled with the washable cartridge filter captures dust either directly into the tank or into a fitted dust bag for hygienic disposal. Remove filters and slide on the foam filter to vacuum liquid.</p>",
